      "message": "AFAIK, pldmd will fail right when it\u0027s trying to init the second terminus and create the inventory object for it. We won\u0027t be able to reach the sensor initialization step of each terminus.\n\nSource https://github.com/openbmc/pldm/blob/3bf24f992f39cbb12b7621a5037e0c54722ca0a8/platform-mc/terminus.cpp#L238",
