      "writtenOn": "2026-07-28T07:26:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "However, if the terminus does not expose an EntityAuxName PDR for itself, or BMC doesn\u0027t use any scheme like EntityManager to rename the terminus, and the 2 termini have the same TID, the TID assigning scheme of BMC will solve the issue, given that BMC won\u0027t let them have duplicate TID and TID will be used for terminus name as the last resort.",
